Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Government pension once paid 50 percent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.02,0:00:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,of last salary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A retired clerk gets it every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.45,0:00:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,month,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved nothing for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.89,0:00:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The government paid,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.11,0:00:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,straight from each year's budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.59,0:00:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing was put aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.75,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So from 2004,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,new central government staff got NPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A slice of salary is saved
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,monthly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pension now depends on how
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that pot grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No fixed promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the Unified Pension Scheme brought
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,back an assured 50 percent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.43,0:00:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,for long service.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.05,0:00:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,NPS is open to private employees
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,too,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,with an extra tax deduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.99,0:00:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not investment advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Send this to your friend in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.67,0:00:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,a private job with no pension
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.61,0:00:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,plan.
